<p><sup><a id="fn.1" href="#fnr.1">1</a></sup>: Perhaps unsurprisingly, the &ldquo;second place&rdquo; posts, those that are popular but not <em>the</em> most popular, tend to be facts about my life or random &ldquo;glitches&rdquo; in my human programming. The more people follow me, the more popular these become, and I tend to get interested in the same kind of posts on other blogs. This is what makes us the indie web, yes?</p>
